{"id":"572809684","kind":"article","title":"卡片分享","author":"Issa Rice","original_authors":["Issa Rice"],"original_source_urls":["https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Card_sharing"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2022-10-12","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":6,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":319,"keywords":["卡片分享","间隔重复","Anki","助记媒介"],"summary":"作者用“卡片分享”概括制卡者与复习者不同的情形，并列举共享 Anki 牌组、使用助记媒介和与学习伙伴共同制卡等场景。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/572809684","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"链接到本文"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"CLGqw5yN\">我试图用<b>卡片分享</b>一词，来概括卡片<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">复习</a>者与撰写者不相同的情况。卡片分享可能出现在如下场合：分享 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Anki\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Anki</a> 牌组、学习《量子国度》或 Orbit 之类助记媒介、或者与学习伙伴共同制作卡片。</p><p data-pid=\"yrztuy_w\">相关页面：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"JfjL4z8x\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Self-graded_prompts_made_for_others_must_provide_guidance_for_grading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">为其他人制作的自主评分卡片需要提供评分指导</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"TW7p6og5\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Card_sharing_allows_less_valuable_cards_to_be_created\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">卡片分享能让你有理由制作价值稍低的卡片</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"F2-bAY-Q\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Existing_implementations_of_card_sharing_have_nontrivial_overhead\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">现存卡片分享手段无不繁琐费力</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"RyhgQrBi\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Booster_card\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">增强卡</a><br/> </li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-1\">链接到本文</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"4Rqu4t1o\"><a class=\"wr